key_decisions.decision:
Tolerance is per pool, paged and nonpaged separately, measured after FsAnalyser.exe exits and corrected for idle drift:
- the whole 10-run series: at most 256 MiB;
- each run after the first of its arm: at most 32 MiB;
- WCsc/WCfc allocs during app runs: 0 above drift;
- PID 4 0x00120089 handles: +0 above drift.
There is no exemption for first-scan cold fill.
